^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ implicit constructor: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ member function reads them: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ user-provided constructor: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.4\] line \d+ most derived class initializes it: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.5\] line \d+ hiding member: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.6\] line \d+ its own mem-initializer: SUCCESS$
